1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,900
Lea, anak.

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,450
Ma?

3
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:06,300
Nakuha namin 'yung pinadala mo.

4
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,100
Salamat, anak.

5
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:11,460
Pero magtira ka rin para sa sarili mo, ha?

6
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,760
Kung hindi ka makauwi ngayong Pasko,

7
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,030
huwag kang mahiyang tumawag.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,230
Kahit wala kang padala.

9
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,000
Anak pa rin kita, kahit malayo ka.

10
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:25,990
Pag-uwi mo, may plato ka pa rin dito.

11
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:32,110
Ma... bakit ngayon ko lang 'to narinig?

12
00:00:36,418 --> 00:00:42,218
Pa, noong tumawag si Mama... ano'ng sinabi niya?
